{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "055b8380-7b12-836e-854c-14ace18ad7af",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T11:54:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sal Cardillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:52:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:52:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. Sorry, I'm whispering. Somebody's sleeping in the next room. I, uh, I want to put up a banner. For a sale."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:53:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A banner on a building, or a freestanding one? And is this a business?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:53:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's, um, on the front of the house. Well, the shop is in the front part. It's just one week. Do I need, what is it, a banner permit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:53:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Temporary banners generally fall under a sign permit. So you'd apply for a sign permit, even for a short run. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:53:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "365 Coggeshall Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:53:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And you own the building, or you're renting the space?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:53:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I own it. Wait, so it's a sign permit, not a banner one? They're different, no? I thought a sign was the wooden kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:53:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know it's confusing. The city treats banners as signs, so it's the same application. You'd give the size, where it hangs, and the dates."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:53:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, hang on, I'm reading this on my e-reader, my notes. The screen's cracked but it still works. So, size and dates. And how long does the approval take? The sale's next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:53:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't promise a number of days from here. It depends on the review and whether historic district rules apply on your street. Best to get the application in right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Historic what? So there might be another approval?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Possibly. The inspector can tell you when they see the application. I can email the form, or you can pick it up at City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, pick up, I think. So sign permit, same as banner, maybe historic. I think I've got it. Mostly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Call back if the form raises questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. Thanks."
    }
  ],
